WEBVTT

01:44.770 --> 01:45.500
Norio-san

01:44.770 --> 01:45.500
Great Pyrenees

01:46.330 --> 01:47.500
Good morning, Norio-san!

01:52.830 --> 01:54.420
C-Could this be...

01:57.940 --> 02:01.210
1:1.618...

02:03.600 --> 02:05.550
Norio-san, I did it!

02:05.550 --> 02:08.670
I finally discovered the golden ratio
between my glasses and my smile!

02:08.670 --> 02:12.360
The Akutagawa Prize? The Nobel Prize?
The Academy Award?

02:15.480 --> 02:19.200
Thank you! Thank you so much!

02:19.200 --> 02:23.330
The Golden Ratio is said to be the most
beautiful thing in the universe!

02:23.680 --> 02:26.500
I have successfully applied the
same ratio used by the Parthenon,

02:26.500 --> 02:30.860
the Venus de Milo, the works of da Vinci,
and the design of the yPod,

02:30.860 --> 02:34.210
to glasses and my smile!

02:35.920 --> 02:39.530
I'm not accepting this award alone.

02:39.530 --> 02:44.130
My research was inspired by my first
meeting with a certain person.

02:44.640 --> 02:47.420
I would like to dedicate
this award to that person.

02:48.840 --> 02:50.340
Soma-senpai!

02:51.220 --> 02:53.950
Please accept it along with me!

02:56.240 --> 02:57.540
Well done.

03:03.740 --> 03:08.750
This is What it Means to Wear Real Glasses!

03:14.850 --> 03:16.210
Hariu-sensei!

03:17.120 --> 03:18.610
Good morning!

03:23.630 --> 03:27.350
Good morning. Your smile looks
especially brilliant today.

03:28.380 --> 03:32.340
That's right. Last night, I got a
sudden call from Shirogane-sensei.

03:32.730 --> 03:35.140
Next thing I knew, I wound up drinking...

03:39.520 --> 03:41.410
You've had a sudden decline in your vision.

03:41.410 --> 03:44.410
It must have been nerve-racking,
having everything around you turn hazy.

03:44.600 --> 03:47.950
But if you put on glasses, the whole world
will become noticeably brighter.

03:55.920 --> 03:57.370
<i>I look dorky.</i>

03:58.680 --> 04:01.390
<i>Things haven't gotten brighter at all.</i>

04:02.010 --> 04:05.560
What's with this? Still no cherry blossoms?

04:05.850 --> 04:08.080
<i>He must have no worries.</i>

04:08.080 --> 04:10.410
<i>Not even about looking
like an idiot in public.</i>

04:11.650 --> 04:15.400
Moving on, I will now
introduce the Glasses Club.

04:15.400 --> 04:17.180
Would the Glasses Club members come forward?

04:19.400 --> 04:21.340
Well, as they don't appear to be here,

04:21.340 --> 04:22.310
we'll move on to—

04:21.630 --> 04:23.320
Hold it!

04:27.000 --> 04:27.920
<i>What's that?!</i>

04:28.070 --> 04:28.870
What is that?

04:29.040 --> 04:29.830
A bird?!

04:30.210 --> 04:31.170
No!

04:31.390 --> 04:32.890
It's glasses!

04:38.970 --> 04:40.330
No glasses,

04:41.330 --> 04:44.840
no life!

04:49.220 --> 04:50.310
Look out!

04:58.690 --> 05:00.240
Idiot! Get out of the way!

05:15.580 --> 05:19.280
<i>You can use your own power
to make the world brighter.</i>

05:20.130 --> 05:24.400
<i>The day I met Soma-senpai was
the first time I realized that.</i>

05:28.360 --> 05:30.480
Solve this problem, Kamatani.

05:31.940 --> 05:33.370
I don't know.

05:36.050 --> 05:39.310
I'm sorry! It was too hard, wasn't it?
That one was my fault.

05:39.510 --> 05:40.560
Glasses!

05:42.570 --> 05:45.330
Soma-senpai! Look at my smile!

05:46.840 --> 05:49.500
Five Laws of the Glasses Club

05:49.500 --> 05:59.000
Five Laws of the Glasses Club
1. No glasses, no life.
1. Never forget to show proper etiquette towards glasses.
1. Speaking ill of glasses is strictly prohibited.
1. Double glasses are forbidden.
1. Fake glasses are forbidden.

05:49.890 --> 05:51.960
One: No glasses, no life.

05:51.960 --> 05:54.660
One: Never forget to show proper
etiquette towards glasses.

05:54.660 --> 05:57.030
One: Speaking ill of glasses
is strictly prohibited.

05:57.040 --> 05:59.000
One: Double glasses are forbidden.

05:59.170 --> 06:00.750
Double glasses?

06:00.750 --> 06:02.960
Yes. That means while
wearing glasses normally,

06:02.970 --> 06:05.550
you also wear another pair
of glasses on your forehead.

06:05.550 --> 06:06.850
Double glasses.

06:06.850 --> 06:10.000
Those who would treat glasses
in such a pointless fashion

06:10.000 --> 06:12.480
are unworthy of the Glasses Club... no,

06:12.480 --> 06:15.010
are unworthy of the human race!

06:16.150 --> 06:17.640
Double glasses!!!

06:17.740 --> 06:20.490
What is the point of wearing
multiple pairs of glasses?

06:18.140 --> 06:21.470
<i>I have to tell him, but...</i>

06:20.490 --> 06:23.220
It's nonsense. Nonsense!

06:23.800 --> 06:26.720
Senpai, please don't go!

06:26.720 --> 06:28.220
Don't try to stop me.

06:28.220 --> 06:30.100
That I didn't realize I was
wearing double glasses

06:30.100 --> 06:31.600
means I haven't trained enough.

06:32.350 --> 06:34.960
I must travel the world,
communing with glasses.

06:35.100 --> 06:36.250
For three years.

06:36.250 --> 06:40.080
Three years? But I'll have
graduated by then!

06:40.580 --> 06:41.910
What do you think, Mitsuki?

06:41.910 --> 06:44.970
I-I think it's wonderful.

06:44.970 --> 06:47.940
No, the sweeping left stroke
on the 5 is imperfect.

06:48.110 --> 06:49.490
Rustle

06:48.370 --> 06:49.880
I'll have to write it over again.

06:50.230 --> 06:52.850
Kimata Hayato has arri—

06:52.370 --> 06:52.850
Squish

06:52.990 --> 06:54.430
Good morning.

06:54.430 --> 06:56.180
Hachimine, you're standing on him.

06:56.180 --> 06:59.690
Oh, I thought I stepped in dog poo.

06:59.690 --> 07:01.740
Thank goodness it was just Hayato-kun.

07:01.740 --> 07:06.780
You packed so much stupidity into one line,
I don't know what to pick apart first.

07:07.970 --> 07:09.490
What's this, president?

07:09.490 --> 07:10.840
For Emergencies Only

07:09.660 --> 07:11.140
Good eye.

07:19.020 --> 07:21.550
Glasses with adjustable prescriptions?

07:21.550 --> 07:22.920
But why?

07:23.170 --> 07:26.210
Things you need to stay
alive in an emergency:

07:26.210 --> 07:30.160
food, water, and glasses!

07:30.160 --> 07:32.050
That's our Soma-senpai!

07:32.050 --> 07:34.530
You're always prepared for any occasion!

07:34.530 --> 07:37.770
That means even if our glasses
break, we don't have to worry.

07:37.770 --> 07:40.740
But for some reason,
there's one pair missing.

07:40.740 --> 07:44.030
I was sure there were five pairs
in there when I opened it.

07:48.420 --> 07:50.490
President, they're on your—

07:52.500 --> 07:55.000
You can't talk, Fake Glasses.

07:52.690 --> 07:55.670
Soma-senpai, your shoelaces are untied.

07:55.890 --> 07:57.490
Oh, really?

07:57.680 --> 07:58.580
<i>My chance!</i>

07:57.850 --> 07:58.580
Remove senpai's double glasses!

08:01.960 --> 08:04.030
Wait, these shoes don't have shoelaces.

08:04.030 --> 08:07.740
I-I'm sorry. My eyes were
playing tricks on me.

08:08.640 --> 08:11.300
<i>In that case, what about this?</i>

08:11.440 --> 08:14.310
Oh no! The screws!

08:15.570 --> 08:16.790
I'm sorry!

08:16.790 --> 08:18.180
Well, better pick them up.

08:18.180 --> 08:18.920
<i>My chance!</i>

08:26.890 --> 08:29.120
There. I think that's all of them.

08:28.880 --> 08:29.750
Dumbfounded

08:29.120 --> 08:31.920
Th-Thank you.

08:32.610 --> 08:34.860
Stare...

08:35.130 --> 08:36.480
What are you looking at?

08:37.370 --> 08:39.410
Stare...

08:43.880 --> 08:46.870
Stare...

08:48.880 --> 08:50.010
For you.

08:50.630 --> 08:52.000
What are you doing?

08:52.000 --> 08:54.340
May I? Thank you.

08:52.000 --> 08:54.340
P-Practicing my tea ceremony!

08:54.540 --> 08:56.200
Members of the Glasses Club

08:56.200 --> 08:58.930
must never forget to show proper
etiquette towards glasses.

08:58.930 --> 09:01.910
Yes. That's an important attitude to have.

09:02.520 --> 09:04.540
I was in the middle of writing
the five laws, wasn't I?

09:14.000 --> 09:15.560
Yukiya-senpai! What are you—

09:16.690 --> 09:19.450
Oh, this? I thought this was in fashion.

09:18.510 --> 09:23.370
Akira's fashion trend

09:18.510 --> 09:23.370
The world's fashion trend

09:19.450 --> 09:21.520
Of course it's not in fashion!

09:22.050 --> 09:23.370
I-Impossible!

09:24.280 --> 09:26.440
What do you think you're doing?!

09:27.080 --> 09:28.200
Is this wrong?

09:28.200 --> 09:29.300
You bet it's wrong!

09:29.300 --> 09:37.510
Double glasses are forbidden.

09:29.810 --> 09:32.010
Double glasses, like fake glasses,

09:32.010 --> 09:34.790
are forbidden in accordance with
the Glasses Club's five laws!

09:34.790 --> 09:37.500
What?! Fake glasses are forbidden now?!

09:37.690 --> 09:39.990
This makes you unworthy of the human race!

09:40.600 --> 09:42.680
I'm sorry. I didn't know.

09:43.100 --> 09:44.610
As long as you understand.

09:44.610 --> 09:46.890
But president, you—

09:56.370 --> 09:57.110
Hit!

10:02.310 --> 10:03.580
The world...

10:03.580 --> 10:05.730
The world's all twisted...

10:05.730 --> 10:08.130
This is what it means to
wear real glasses.

10:08.130 --> 10:10.550
I see! Then I'll bear it!

10:10.550 --> 10:13.300
I'll bear it and show you I can be
a real member of the club!

10:11.250 --> 10:12.610
<i>Now I can...</i>

10:13.300 --> 10:14.730
Soma-senpai!

10:15.820 --> 10:17.410
Look at me!

10:17.410 --> 10:19.710
<i>I'll blind him with my golden ratio smile,</i>

10:19.710 --> 10:22.320
<i>and while he's distracted,
snatch the glasses from his head!</i>

10:22.320 --> 10:24.950
<i>You're the only one who can
stop Senpai from going away!</i>

10:24.950 --> 10:28.250
<i>Mitsuki, Senpai's fate is
riding on your smile!</i>

10:28.250 --> 10:31.120
<i>Smile! Smile, Mitsuki!</i>

10:40.050 --> 10:42.680
<i>I'm so useless!</i>

10:42.680 --> 10:46.040
Wh-What's wrong?
Are you not feeling well?

10:46.040 --> 10:49.670
I'll run the 100-meter dash
in this twisted world!

11:06.640 --> 11:07.440
I...

11:09.460 --> 11:11.010
I did it!

11:26.290 --> 11:28.840
I can still see stars when I close my eyes.

11:28.840 --> 11:31.340
I'm so, so sorry!

11:31.770 --> 11:32.750
Mitsuki!

11:36.970 --> 11:40.320
Smile normally from now on. Okay?

11:45.890 --> 11:49.100
Glasses!

11:51.680 --> 11:52.660
Okay!

12:29.140 --> 12:30.330
What?

12:31.300 --> 12:32.680
Cream...

12:34.660 --> 12:35.740
Cr...

12:35.740 --> 12:40.460
Cream!

12:49.670 --> 12:54.670
Glasses Reflect the Soul and Who You Truly Are

12:56.040 --> 12:59.700
Ow. I fell asleep with my glasses on again.

13:00.380 --> 13:01.460
Huh?

13:09.020 --> 13:10.020
There.

13:13.710 --> 13:15.710
It's okay, it's okay.

13:19.300 --> 13:21.660
Takuma-kun, are you awake?

13:22.500 --> 13:23.580
Yes...

13:34.730 --> 13:36.630
Big brother Shin, good morning.

13:38.060 --> 13:39.890
Good morning, Takuma.

13:38.060 --> 13:40.750
Hachimine Shinji
(2nd Brother)

13:41.680 --> 13:43.920
Still sleeping, huh?

13:46.450 --> 13:47.720
I'm hungry.

13:49.460 --> 13:50.480
Glasses.

13:58.930 --> 14:00.730
I did it again.

14:00.730 --> 14:04.730
Rinse      Cycle      Wash      Spin      Preset

14:10.210 --> 14:11.460
Down and out!

14:12.390 --> 14:13.930
Morning, big brother.

14:13.310 --> 14:23.380
Hachimine Satoru
(Oldest Brother)

14:13.930 --> 14:15.530
Good morning, Takuma-kun!

14:15.530 --> 14:19.070
Look! There was a super
stubborn stain right here!

14:19.070 --> 14:23.380
But, but! Look how clean it got
without losing the original color!

14:23.380 --> 14:26.140
Big brother Satoru, I can't see.

14:26.140 --> 14:30.480
Ah! Don't look! You'll get soap
in your eyes, so don't look!

14:32.560 --> 14:33.310
Cycle                           Wash                               Spin

14:38.040 --> 14:39.590
Big brother, telephone.

14:39.590 --> 14:40.930
Yes, yes!

14:40.930 --> 14:44.240
Takuma-kun, could you put the clothes in
the basket when the spin cycle finishes?

14:44.240 --> 14:45.320
Okay.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.890
I'm sorry!

14:48.030 --> 14:49.330
Glasses!

14:49.330 --> 14:53.850
Rinse      Cycle      Wash      Spin      Preset

14:53.850 --> 14:56.820
Wash      Spin      Preset

14:55.740 --> 14:56.820
Huh?

14:59.690 --> 15:03.100
Huh? Glasses, glasses...

15:07.120 --> 15:08.460
Glasses!

15:15.540 --> 15:17.320
They won't stay on.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.480
Big bro—

15:22.860 --> 15:24.480
...the glasses that my brothers bought for me on
that first day of high school, glittering like shining candy...

15:22.860 --> 15:24.480
Congratulations on starting high school!

15:25.370 --> 15:27.100
Take good care of them.

15:27.100 --> 15:29.600
Okay! Thanks, big brother!

15:27.800 --> 15:28.740
Takuma-kun starts
high school.

15:39.110 --> 15:40.320
Did you call?

15:40.320 --> 15:42.320
The spin cycle is done.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.760
Got it!

15:47.910 --> 15:49.610
What do I do?

16:01.820 --> 16:03.660
Why curry in the morning?

16:03.660 --> 16:05.270
It's dinner.

16:05.270 --> 16:08.580
I'm going to cook it through,
then let it stew for the day.

16:11.700 --> 16:12.750
Takuma...

16:13.660 --> 16:15.240
Wh-What?

16:21.730 --> 16:25.470
Café au lait. Made with the
extra rich milk you like.

16:26.780 --> 16:28.770
Th-Thank you.

16:28.770 --> 16:30.800
Hey, what about mine?

16:30.800 --> 16:32.560
Make your own.

16:32.560 --> 16:33.720
Meanie!

16:35.730 --> 16:37.730
Let's eat.

16:48.490 --> 16:49.490
What is it?

16:59.940 --> 17:02.120
There! Perfect.

17:02.120 --> 17:04.270
Th-Thanks.

17:27.210 --> 17:28.540
My glasses...

17:28.540 --> 17:29.660
Here we go.

17:31.560 --> 17:32.560
A cat?

17:33.940 --> 17:36.540
Cat! Cat!

17:40.210 --> 17:42.080
That's right. My glasses...

17:44.340 --> 17:45.090
Glasse—

17:51.950 --> 17:53.700
They're so scratched up.

17:56.090 --> 17:57.970
Please donate!

17:59.480 --> 18:01.480
Please donate!

18:05.700 --> 18:07.020
That's it.

18:12.600 --> 18:14.520
I felt a sudden chill.

18:21.970 --> 18:25.440
A shiver just went up my spine.

18:26.250 --> 18:27.250
Big brother.

18:28.860 --> 18:30.040
That's...

18:32.430 --> 18:36.970
Glasses, glasses, glasses...

18:36.970 --> 18:39.320
Glasses, my glasses...

18:52.480 --> 18:54.900
Soma-senpai! What's wrong?

18:54.900 --> 18:57.900
If you're going to stare at
something, stare at me!

18:58.360 --> 19:00.040
Yukiya, you...

19:01.060 --> 19:03.160
...changed your nose pads.

19:02.140 --> 19:03.160
Also called "nose piece."

19:03.460 --> 19:05.650
I'm impressed you noticed, Akira.

19:05.650 --> 19:07.920
Yes. Of course I did.

19:08.230 --> 19:11.930
I recognized that your glasses stood
parallel to the ground below!

19:12.350 --> 19:15.000
The feeling of stability is exceptional.

19:15.000 --> 19:17.050
That's our president!

19:17.050 --> 19:19.890
Glasses reflect the soul
and who you truly are.

19:20.260 --> 19:21.500
Remember this.

19:21.500 --> 19:24.140
To understand a person's glasses is to
comprehend their state of mind.

19:24.140 --> 19:25.640
You're wonderful, senpai!

19:25.640 --> 19:26.890
Hey!

19:27.050 --> 19:28.300
Ev...

19:29.140 --> 19:30.390
...ery...

19:31.330 --> 19:33.060
...one!

19:33.240 --> 19:36.080
Good morning!

19:36.080 --> 19:37.580
<i>No comprehending that!</i>

19:37.580 --> 19:41.030
Glasses reflect the soul
and who you truly are.

19:37.970 --> 19:40.960
I can't begin to imagine
how he got to that state.

19:40.960 --> 19:45.380
He always seemed so lighthearted, but
he must have darkness deep in his heart.

19:45.380 --> 19:47.500
You're not one to talk, Mitsuki.

19:49.480 --> 19:50.480
Takuma!

19:50.480 --> 19:51.880
I made it in time!

19:51.880 --> 19:53.680
What happened to you, Takuma?

19:53.680 --> 19:56.810
Don't you love my take on the fashion trend?

19:56.810 --> 19:59.440
Your take on what?
There's no trend like this!

19:59.440 --> 20:02.850
What's wrong, Takuma? What happened
to you? Hey! Speak to me!

20:03.670 --> 20:05.130
Takuma-kun!

20:03.670 --> 20:05.130
Takuma!

20:05.320 --> 20:06.590
Brothers!

20:06.590 --> 20:08.380
B-Brothers?

20:10.060 --> 20:13.090
What? Is that the model, Shinji?

20:13.040 --> 20:14.860
No. 1 Glasses Idol
Genius Model SINJI

20:13.040 --> 20:14.860
Fashion point techniques
for a hot stoic look
SINJI Photo Collection

20:13.290 --> 20:13.850
Glasses Boy Ranking
Glasses Accessory
Refuge for His Pursuit

20:15.040 --> 20:18.570
And that's the designer
Hachimine Satoru!

20:18.570 --> 20:21.110
He was featured on Passionate
Glasses Continent the other day!

20:19.130 --> 20:21.110
Glasses
Passionate
Continent

20:19.130 --> 20:21.110
Genius Designer

20:21.270 --> 20:24.390
Are those two Takuma-senpai's...?

20:24.740 --> 20:26.450
Yes. His older brothers.

20:26.450 --> 20:31.920
Amazing! I didn't know you had such cool
older brothers, Hachimine-senpai!

20:31.920 --> 20:34.120
What happened to your glasses?

20:35.460 --> 20:37.150
Well...

20:37.650 --> 20:38.880
Changing my image?

20:41.600 --> 20:43.100
They broke, didn't they?

20:44.090 --> 20:45.610
Sorry.

20:45.610 --> 20:47.420
I thought this might happen.

20:53.940 --> 20:55.290
Those are...

20:55.460 --> 20:59.570
To ensure that you won't have to worry
if you ever run into glasses trouble,

20:59.570 --> 21:01.710
we keep spares ready.

21:01.710 --> 21:02.940
How are they?

21:06.010 --> 21:09.290
They're perfect! That's amazing, brothers!

21:11.390 --> 21:13.390
That's what brothers are for!

21:13.980 --> 21:16.970
Brothers don't usually go that far, do they?

21:16.970 --> 21:18.470
They spoil him.

21:18.470 --> 21:21.920
I guess that's how Takuma-senpai
ended up so easygoing.

21:21.920 --> 21:23.760
Right, Soma-senpai?

21:24.090 --> 21:26.730
It's natural to treasure your little brother.

21:27.490 --> 21:29.530
Have you had any other problems?

21:29.530 --> 21:30.490
No.

21:30.490 --> 21:31.970
Just tell us next time, okay?

21:34.570 --> 21:35.570
Okay!

23:11.860 --> 23:13.780
The temple tips are the parts
that rest on your ears.

23:12.140 --> 23:19.390
Temple Tips

23:12.720 --> 23:15.890
Ear

23:13.780 --> 23:15.790
They're important parts that
keep your glasses balanced.

23:14.950 --> 23:15.760
Important Parts

23:15.790 --> 23:17.320
They let Takumi use his crafty side today!

23:16.470 --> 23:19.390
Takumi

23:17.320 --> 23:19.120
Takumi-san is amazing!

23:17.470 --> 23:19.390
Takumi-san
is amazing!

23:19.120 --> 23:23.630
A true glasses wearer must never refer
to them as "those ear things."

23:19.640 --> 23:20.960
A true glasses wearer

23:21.090 --> 23:21.460
Never!!

23:21.560 --> 23:23.620
"Those ear things."

23:23.650 --> 23:25.970
No Glasses, No Life

23:30.690 --> 23:34.060
Round Boston. Tomorrow's horoscope:

23:34.790 --> 23:37.980
I hope Senpai's in a good mood...
